あります( ˙˘˙ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして昨日「SIGNALポーズ」を\nブログに載せたのですが\n沢山取り直しとかしてフォルダに\n入っているのでぜひ別角度も（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/yuuri.saito/img/2017/05/07/6487571/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それとね本当は7/2のTWICEの\nshowcase行く気まんまんだったのに\n自分達のライブと被っていて\n行けないことになりました(TT)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃめちゃ悔しいです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"会場も本当に近くて見に行くつもりだったのに\nこんなに悔しいことなんて............."},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんなチャンス滅多にないのに...ううう\n行ける方は本当に楽しんできて下さい\nTWICEちゃん達を一生懸命\n応援してあげてほしいです◎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"♡告知♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5/15 songs"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かなとアルバムのことについて\nお喋りさせて頂きました\n可愛く写真も沢山撮って頂いてそれに\nライティングもとっても綺麗で本当に\n素敵なものに仕上がってると思います！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5/19 25:25〜25:55\n広島ホームテレビ「H♪LINE」"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"蘭世とみなみと広島に行ってきたもの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"5/20 22:20〜22:53"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"バナナゼロミュージック"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏とみなみと楽しくわちゃわちゃ\nクイズしましたよ\\ ♪♪ /"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして明日のTHE魂(ソウル)20:00〜にて\nアルバム楽曲の私とみさ先輩と\nまいちゅんが参加しているユニット\n「醜い私」が初オンエアになります♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"どのタイミングでかかるかは\nまだ分からないので3時間\nまるまる聴いたら絶対に\n聴き逃しないと思うので\nよろしくお願いします（笑）"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"3人での少人数ユニットはじめてですし\n本当に嬉しかったのでぜひとも\n多くの方に聞いてもらいたいです♡♡♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それではまたTHE魂でよろしくね？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たんたんたん ゆったんたん( •ㅈ• )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"_"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-707":{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"こんばんみさみさ(*´｀*)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日久しぶりに温泉に入って\nこんな時間なのに\nテンション高山なみさみさです"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart04.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"わ〜〜〜〜(･∀･)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/scissors.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねね・まりか・まひろと\n一緒に入ってきたよ♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もうな、久しぶりすぎて\n本当気持ちよかった〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"大分は温泉がいっぱいあるから\n大分に居た頃は\nかなりの頻度で行ってて\n学校帰りに友達と入って\n帰ったりする日も\n珍しくありませんでした(^-^)笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"26日の【風呂の日】は\n安くなるので毎月行ってたよ。\n学生に優しい〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/scissors.gif","alt":""},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさの生活の中に\n温泉は必要不可欠(´_ゝ｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だったから、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"上京してから一回も\n行けてなかったから\n今日行けて本当嬉しかったよー泣\nんーもう温泉大好きっ♪♪\nサウナも岩盤浴も好き♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"冬は体の芯から冷えるし\nみなさんも時間あったときは\n温泉行って暖まってね〜？\n東京でおすすめの温泉\n知っている方！おったら\n教えてください(･v･)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"また行きたいなーっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そして今日は撮影でした！\nみんなと"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/shine.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"誰が写ってるカナ？？♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/27/img_0445.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今は ねねと同じ部屋"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/fullmoon.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾟ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さっきまで話しよったに\nもう寝たみたい(´･ω･｀)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"小さくて布団の中に\nちょこん♪って感じに\n収まってて可愛いんです！笑"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"みさ背が高いから\n小さい子見ると\n可愛いなーって思う(´_ゝ｀)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだか\n守ってあげたくなるよね！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はお香をたいて寝ます♪\n最近買ったばかりの\nバニラの香り...(*´｀*)\n落ち着くー。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"部屋中が\nいい香りになったところで\nみさも寝るとします。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なんだかゆっくり眠れそう♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/uncategorized/2011/12/27/img_5760.jpg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ねねちゃん前向いて〜(><)\nじゃあまた明日"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/misa.eto/img/blog/photos/icon/heart01.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日も最後まで読んでくれて\nありがとうございました♪\nみなさんおやすみ〜(^-^)"}],"source":"archive"},"crw-nogi-19346":{"blocks":[{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/07/11/8813910/0000.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"皆様見て下さいましたか〜ヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日のMステは過去最多の人数が出演したということで、歌って、見ていて本当に楽しかったです！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"夏のFree＆Easy皆様のお陰でオリコンディリーランキングも1位を取ることができました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"本当にありがとうございます！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"アイドル、乃木坂を好きな人以外の方も手にとって下さってるみたいです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"めちゃ嬉しいですねっ"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/07/11/8813910/0001.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/rina.ikoma/img/blog/rina.ikoma/img/2014/07/11/8813910/0002.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"れなさん乃木坂46として初のMステヽ(・∀・)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近はついにれなさんのおしりをさわってしまいましたよ〜⭐︎"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うふふ♡"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"さぁ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"頑張るぞっ！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"へばなっ！⭐︎"}],"source":"archive"}}